{"id":"4d85024ac1a242df","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-cat2-slice-category.md","title":"ZFC Cat2 Slice Category","display":"df-zfc-cat2-slice-category — ZFC Cat2 Slice Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat2-slice-category","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat2-slice-category"],"display":"df-zfc-cat2-slice-category — ZFC Cat2 Slice Category","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat2-slice-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat2-slice-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat2-slice-category — ZFC Cat2 Slice Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal S,X,O,M,s,t,c,e,O_X,M_X,s_X,t_X,c_X,e_X\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal S,X,O,M,s,t,c,e,O_X,M_X,s_X,t_X,c_X,e_X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2SliceCategory}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2SliceCategory}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}slice\\text{-}category}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcCat2SliceCategory}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal C,X)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e,O_X,M_X,s_X,t_X,c_X,e_X\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\\land\\mathcal S=\\langle O_X,M_X,s_X,t_X,c_X,e_X\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land X\\in O\\\\\n&amp;\\land O_X=\\{\\langle A,f\\rangle\\in O\\times M:s(f)=A\\land t(f)=X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land M_X=\\{\\langle\\langle A,f\\rangle,h,\\langle B,g\\rangle\\rangle\\in O_X\\times M\\times O_X:s(h)=A\\land t(h)=B\\land c(\\langle g,h\\rangle)=f\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u,h,v\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\langle u,h,v\\rangle\\in M_X\\to s_X(\\langle u,h,v\\rangle)=u\\land t_X(\\langle u,h,v\\rangle)=v\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\forall f\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\langle A,f\\rangle\\in O_X\\to e_X(\\langle A,f\\rangle)=\\langle\\langle A,f\\rangle,e(A),\\langle A,f\\rangle\\rangle\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u,h,v,k,w\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\langle u,h,v\\rangle\\in M_X\\land\\langle v,k,w\\rangle\\in M_X\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\to c_X(\\langle\\langle v,k,w\\rangle,\\langle u,h,v\\rangle\\rangle)=\\langle u,c(\\langle k,h\\rangle),w\\rangle\\Bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal S)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}slice\\text{-}category}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcCat2SliceCategory}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal C,X)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e,O_X,M_X,s_X,t_X,c_X,e_X\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\\land\\mathcal S=\\langle O_X,M_X,s_X,t_X,c_X,e_X\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land X\\in O\\\\\n&amp;\\land O_X=\\{\\langle A,f\\rangle\\in O\\times M:s(f)=A\\land t(f)=X\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land M_X=\\{\\langle\\langle A,f\\rangle,h,\\langle B,g\\rangle\\rangle\\in O_X\\times M\\times O_X:s(h)=A\\land t(h)=B\\land c(\\langle g,h\\rangle)=f\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u,h,v\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\langle u,h,v\\rangle\\in M_X\\to s_X(\\langle u,h,v\\rangle)=u\\land t_X(\\langle u,h,v\\rangle)=v\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\forall f\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\langle A,f\\rangle\\in O_X\\to e_X(\\langle A,f\\rangle)=\\langle\\langle A,f\\rangle,e(A),\\langle A,f\\rangle\\rangle\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u,h,v,k,w\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\langle u,h,v\\rangle\\in M_X\\land\\langle v,k,w\\rangle\\in M_X\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\to c_X(\\langle\\langle v,k,w\\rangle,\\langle u,h,v\\rangle\\rangle)=\\langle u,c(\\langle k,h\\rangle),w\\rangle\\Bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal S)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>两个类别编码均在断言内显式解包；源、靶、恒等与复合全部调用对应集合函数，避免把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\">\\(\\circ\\)</span> 当成未绑定的中缀操作。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal S,X,O,M,s,t,c,e,O_X,M_X,s_X,t_X,c_X,e_X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2SliceCategory}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}slice\\text{-}category}\\vdash{}&\\mathrm{ZfcCat2SliceCategory}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal C,X)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e,O_X,M_X,s_X,t_X,c_X,e_X\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\\land\\mathcal S=\\langle O_X,M_X,s_X,t_X,c_X,e_X\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land X\\in O\\\\\n&\\land O_X=\\{\\langle A,f\\rangle\\in O\\times M:s(f)=A\\land t(f)=X\\}\\\\\n&\\land M_X=\\{\\langle\\langle A,f\\rangle,h,\\langle B,g\\rangle\\rangle\\in O_X\\times M\\times O_X:s(h)=A\\land t(h)=B\\land c(\\langle g,h\\rangle)=f\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall u,h,v\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\langle u,h,v\\rangle\\in M_X\\to s_X(\\langle u,h,v\\rangle)=u\\land t_X(\\langle u,h,v\\rangle)=v\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in O\\;\\forall f\\in M\\;\\bigl(\\langle A,f\\rangle\\in O_X\\to e_X(\\langle A,f\\rangle)=\\langle\\langle A,f\\rangle,e(A),\\langle A,f\\rangle\\rangle\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall u,h,v,k,w\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\langle u,h,v\\rangle\\in M_X\\land\\langle v,k,w\\rangle\\in M_X\\\\\n&\\hspace{28mm}\\to c_X(\\langle\\langle v,k,w\\rangle,\\langle u,h,v\\rangle\\rangle)=\\langle u,c(\\langle k,h\\rangle),w\\rangle\\Bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal S)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\circ","display":false}],"bytes":1958,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1589","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-cat2-slice-category.md|58-df-zfc-cat2-slice-category]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a87b7e1119b63b2c"]}